# Pretrained Models (downloaded)
Style-Bert-VITS2/pretrained/*.safetensors
Style-Bert-VITS2/pretrained/*.pth
Style-Bert-VITS2/pretrained_jp_extra/*.safetensors
Style-Bert-VITS2/pretrained_jp_extra/*.pth

